#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Weather Station Options"
msgstr "Optschonen vun de Wederstatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "ICAO location code:"
msgstr "ICAO Oort-Code"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "Enter the 4 character <BR> ICAO location code for your station."
msgstr "Geev den 4 Bookstaven langen <BR> ICAO Ooort-Code för dien Statschoon in."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid ""
"Enter the 4 character ICAO location code here. A search page has been "
"provided at:  "
"<BR><a href=\"http://www.nws.noaa.gov/tg/siteloc.shtml\"> "
"http://www.nws.noaa.gov/tg/siteloc.shtml</a><BR>\n"
"Examples of codes are: KPNE, KMKE, EDDA<BR>\n"
"<B>NOTE:</B><i>  You may have better luck with manned stations than with "
"automated monitoring stations.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Lookup Your ICAO Code"
msgstr "Dienen ICAO-Oort-Code rutsöken"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "http://www.nws.noaa.gov/tg/siteloc.shtml"
msgstr "http://www.nws.noaa.gov/tg/siteloc.shtml"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Click on this link to<BR> search for your ICAO code."
msgstr "Klick hier um dienen ICAO Oort-Code <BR>ruttosöken"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Clicking on this link will open your web browser with the <b>NOAA</b>'s "
"search page. This search page will allow you to find the closest weather "
"station to your location."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Panel Display Options"
msgstr "Optschonen för't Wiesen in dat Paneel"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Show icon only"
msgstr "Blots Lüttbild wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Click here to show only <BR> the weather icon."
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du blots dat Lüttbild vun't Weder sehn wullt."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid ""
"This feature will allow you to make KWeather take up only one slot on the "
"kicker. Normally this application will take up two slots. The small view "
"will only show the weather icon, while the normal view will display both the "
"icon and the current weather statistics. For the small view the weather "
"statistics will be put on the buttons tool tip."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Show icon and temperature"
msgstr "Lüttbild un Temperatuur wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Show icon, temperature, wind and pressure information"
msgstr ""
"Lüttbild, Temperatuur un Informatschoon över den Wind un den Luftdruck "
"wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Lo&gging Options"
msgstr "Optschoonen för't Lo&gbook"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "E&nable logging"
msgstr "Logbook &anmaken"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Log file:"
msgstr "Logdatei:"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Enter the logfile name."
msgstr "Geev den Naam vun de Logdatei in."

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Enter the full path and filename to enable logging in KWeather."
msgstr "Geev den helen Padd und Dateinamen an um dat Logbook vun KWeather antomaken."

